# `%r1.h0` selects the low half of %r1, and the `vadd` writes all of
# %r1, so the address after it is not the thread index's but unknown;
# it was read as `4 * %tid.x + param_0` where ptxas stores to param_0
# from all 32 threads.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/micro/video_selector.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (depends on special register %tid.x, behind `vadd.u32.u32.u32`){{$}}
